      "content": "i dont even know if \"small moments\" are worth the cost anymore. what's the point of finding a community if i still feel like an observer instead of a participant? it feels like a life sentence of just... trying. sometimes i look at the world and it just seems so much more peaceful when nothing is happening, when there's just nothingness. like, wouldn't it be easier to just stop the noise entirely instead of constantly fighting to stay in a room where you don't belong?",
